{{Quote|That's impossible, something's pulled us out of hyperspace and put us down in the Atravis sector. We're in the Outer Rim.|[[ZO-E3]], to the [[Corvax descendant|captain]] of the ''[[Windfall]]''|<ref name="Vader Immortal – Episode I">{{VaderImmortal|I}}</ref>}}
The '''Atravis sector''' was a [[sector]] within the [[Outer Rim Territories]] of [[the galaxy]]. Within it was the [[planet]] [[Mustafar]] and the rest of its [[Mustafar system|solar system]].<ref name="Ultimate SW" />

